  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Age Gatekeeper\r\n\r\nPlan how your video streaming platform decides **who can view what**. \r\n\r\nChoose **two questions** that will lead to **four different viewing experiences**. Fill in the flowchart and test cases table based on your plan.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Define the **inputs** (states or controls) that drive each **decision** (diamond).\r\n\r\n2. Fill in all **three decision points** with a question and all **four outcomes**, where each outcome states **who can view the content**.\r\n\r\n3. Fill in the **Test Cases table** with one row for each path, showing how the different inputs lead to each outcome.\r\n\r\n4. Save your **flowchart to your Backpack** and add it to your files in the next level.",
    "display_name": "Age Gatekeeper",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Decide who can view what based on age or consent.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/bacefea833f1a68f00d1c28d3af0a569-Icon Template.jpg",
